  "content_html": "<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><strong>Shimmer Body Spray Romantic Date — a delicate glow that will make your date truly unforgettable!</strong></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://uniksshop.com/content/uploads/images/sprey-01.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>This shimmer body spray combines a lightweight fragrance, nourishing care, and a delicate silver shimmer — without a sticky feel.</p>\n<p><br/>\n<strong>Pink glitters </strong>— food-grade shimmering particles create an attractive brilliant glow on the skin, enhancing your natural beauty and making the skin look enchanting.<br/>\n<strong>Pearl extract</strong> delivers rejuvenating effect and delicate luminosity.<br/>\n<strong>Weightless texture: </strong>The spray applies effortlessly, absorbs quickly, and leaves no sticky residue.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://uniksshop.com/content/uploads/images/sprey-03.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>Perfect for evening events, photoshoots, special occasions, or whenever you want to infuse a touch of \"wow-effect\" into your everyday life.</p>\n<p><strong>Volume:</strong> 155 ml — the perfect size for daily use, delivering a long-lasting fragrance and an enduring glow.</p>\n<p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-sPJarjikZM\">https://www.youtube.com/embed/-sPJarjikZM</a></p></p>\n </div>\n</div>",
