 class=\"product__column-item\">\n<div class=\"product__group product__group--tabs\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<nav class=\"product-heading__nav\" id=\"nav-6af745df6435e\">\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#description-3\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\">Description</div>\n</a>\n<a class=\"product-heading__tab\" href=\"#reviews-3\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title\"><div id=\"comments\">\n            A new review or comment    </div>\n</div>\n</a>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"description-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div class=\"product-description j-product-description\" itemprop=\"description\">\n<div class=\"text\">\n<p><strong>Shimmer Body Spray Romantic Date — a delicate glow that will make your date truly unforgettable!</strong></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://uniksshop.com/content/uploads/images/sprey-01.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>This shimmer body spray combines a lightweight fragrance, nourishing care, and a delicate silver shimmer — without a sticky feel.</p>\n<p><br/>\n<strong>Pink glitters </strong>— food-grade shimmering particles create an attractive brilliant glow on the skin, enhancing your natural beauty and making the skin look enchanting.<br/>\n<strong>Pearl extract</strong> delivers rejuvenating effect and delicate luminosity.<br/>\n<strong>Weightless texture: </strong>The spray applies effortlessly, absorbs quickly, and leaves no sticky residue.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" height=\"750\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://uniksshop.com/content/uploads/images/sprey-03.jpg\" width=\"600\"/></p>\n<p>Perfect for evening events, photoshoots, special occasions, or whenever you want to infuse a touch of \"wow-effect\" into your everyday life.</p>\n<p><strong>Volume:</strong> 155 ml — the perfect size for daily use, delivering a long-lasting fragrance and an enduring glow.</p>\n<p><p><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/-sPJarjikZM\">https://www.youtube.com/embed/-sPJarjikZM</a></p></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"j-product-block__tab\" data-content-id=\"reviews-3\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<section class=\"product-reviews\">\n<div class=\"reviews\" id=\"comments-container-uid3d90a62f675bf9b714c75d9083eaa2ff\">\n<div class=\"reviews__inner\">\n<div class=\"p-review\" id=\"uid3d90a62f675bf9b714c75d9083eaa2ff\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"reviews__add-comment\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</div> </div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom\">\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"fb80e4c32885a6597f8e3a8bcb249a9c\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts_1\">\n<div class=\"product__section\">\n<div id=\"c3f0fedbd1b0a486429d6d74ca332432\" style=\"position: relative; height: 20px\">\n<div class=\"loader\" style=\"width: 10px; height: 10px; margin: 10px 0 50px -5px; left: 50%\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"product__bottom-item\">\n<div class=\"j-product-block\">\n<div class=\"product-heading\">\n<div class=\"product-heading__title j-product-block-title\"><div class=\"j-product-block-title\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div data-view-block=\"associatedProducts_2\">\n<div class=\"pro